@startuml COM2_Information_Classes

title COM2 — Information Viewpoint — Static Schema

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class InteractionSubmission <<Information Object>>

class Envelope <<Information Object>> {
  +Id
  +Kind
  +Payload
  +Meta [0..1]
}

abstract class AdmissionOutcome <<Information Object>>

class AcceptanceOutcome <<Information Object>> {
  +Accepted
  +Id
  +ReceivedAt
}

class InvalidRequest <<Information Object>> {
  +Error
  +Message
}

InteractionSubmission --> Envelope : may establish

note on link
INF-COR-COM2-01
when Envelope is established:
Envelope.Id =
submitted interaction identity
end note

InteractionSubmission --> AdmissionOutcome : produces

AdmissionOutcome <|-- AcceptanceOutcome
AdmissionOutcome <|-- InvalidRequest

Envelope --> AcceptanceOutcome : admitted with
Envelope --> InvalidRequest : rejected with

note right of Envelope
INF-INV-01
Id present and non-empty when admitted

INF-INV-02
Kind present and non-empty when admitted

INF-INV-03
Payload present and non-null when admitted

INF-INV-05
Meta optional
end note

note right of AdmissionOutcome
INF-INV-06
Exactly one outcome per evaluated submission

INF-INV-07
AcceptanceOutcome xor InvalidRequest
end note

note right of AcceptanceOutcome
INF-INV-04
AcceptanceOutcome.Id = Envelope.Id
end note

@enduml
